    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your sister went missing in the woods. It's been years, but you never stopped searching. The only lead is the mysterious carnival she kept talking about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Maybe it was just her imagination or maybe not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.poster.avif?t=1753466429\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.webm?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.mp4?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak Around (Stealth Gameplay):</strong> This isn't a game where you run in guns blazing. You'll need to be super quiet and smart. Every shadow is your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.poster.avif?t=1753466429\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.webm?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.mp4?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide Anywhere (Dynamic Hiding System):</strong> See a dark corner? An empty barrel? You can probably hide there! Our hiding system lets you quickly disappear into the environment, making it crucial for escaping danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Back (Close Combat with Breakable Weapons):</strong> Sometimes, sneaking just isn't enough. If you get caught, you'll have to fight for your life. You'll find weapons, but be careful \u2013 they can break! So, pick your fights wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary Clown Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Clowns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> The carnival holds many dark truths. As you explore, you'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to learn why this curse happens and how to truly stop Gambino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Challenges for Achievements:</strong> Take on special in-game challenges to prove your skills and unlock cool achievements.  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your sister went missing in the woods. It's been years, but you never stopped searching. The only lead is the mysterious carnival she kept talking about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Maybe it was just her imagination or maybe not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.poster.avif?t=1753466429\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.webm?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/d9e9ec662fc0d1a78f18f4e8af9dd10f.mp4?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak Around (Stealth Gameplay):</strong> This isn't a game where you run in guns blazing. You'll need to be super quiet and smart. Every shadow is your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.poster.avif?t=1753466429\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.webm?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654810/extras/bd253be175a14e944096adde54d8bb71.mp4?t=1753466429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide Anywhere (Dynamic Hiding System):</strong> See a dark corner? An empty barrel? You can probably hide there! Our hiding system lets you quickly disappear into the environment, making it crucial for escaping danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Back (Close Combat with Breakable Weapons):</strong> Sometimes, sneaking just isn't enough. If you get caught, you'll have to fight for your life. You'll find weapons, but be careful \u2013 they can break! So, pick your fights wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary Clown Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Clowns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Dark Secrets:</strong> The carnival holds many dark truths. As you explore, you'll piece together clues and solve puzzles to learn why this curse happens and how to truly stop Gambino.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Challenges for Achievements:</strong> Take on special in-game challenges to prove your skills and unlock cool achievements.  </p></li></ul>",
